{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/link-foundation/meta-language/pulls/201","id":4773059589,"node_id":"PR_kwDOSyCSfs8AAAABHH8cBQ","html_url":"https://github.com/link-foundation/meta-language/pull/201","diff_url":"https://github.com/link-foundation/meta-language/pull/201.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/link-foundation/meta-language/pull/201.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/link-foundation/meta-language/issues/201","number":201,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"Issue #199: scope validation, bounded evidence, translation parity and native grammars","user":{"login":"konard","id":1431904,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE0MzE5MDQ=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1431904?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard","html_url":"https://github.com/konard","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"This draft PR implements the remaining issue #199 scope and the [delivery audit](https://github.com/link-foundation/meta-language/pull/201#issuecomment-6059812347). Delivery is unfinished: the ledger retains 359 atomic requirements and 439 fixture identities, with 13 requirements still lacking implementation entry points. There is no issue-closing directive.\n\nThe current head is `e46e196d`. [Full CI](https://github.com/link-foundation/meta-language/actions/runs/38041523997) is evaluating that head. The previous run passed JavaScript grammar, conformance, tooling and downstream suites, then found deterministic ordering drift in generated embedded-region expectations. This batch sorts those keys without changing their trees or removing assertions.\n\nThe native grammar inventory now contains 43 entries. Recent replacements include Python, Groovy, Lua, HCL, R, XML, DTD, Odin, HTML and Agda, with their production parser crates and WebAssembly modules moved to development oracles. HTML's 44 authored valid sources and nine invalid sources pass focused checks in both runtimes. Its script and style regions retain leading whitespace, table rows and cells settle required implicit closures, and default CST fixtures retain independent embedded-region boundaries. Odin's 52 authored valid sources and eight invalid sources pass focused parity checks. Agda's 37 authored valid sources, seven invalid sources and four explicit layout divergences pass focused checks in both runtimes. Its shared native scanner retains indentation and pending layout tokens; development oracle inputs use fresh processes because the pinned scanner's queue growth depends on allocator history. Pinned parser assets and oracle assertions remain intact. CI executes pinned upstream corpora and the complete regression suites.\n\nShared scanner operations now provide single-scalar uppercase conversion, and lookahead predicates observe preceding state mutations. Self-translation has gained generated frontend helpers and generic binding, capture, immutable-array and exact source-restoration behavior. Zero carried constructs, full-language translation, complete construct semantics, the remaining catalog imports, complete multi-source grammar unions, independent acceptance oracles, grammar interchange under actual tools and formal-ai projection pairs remain open.\n\nFocused JavaScript and Rust tests, report consistency, metadata, naming, documentation, Rust formatting and the no-default-features all-targets check pass for the latest batch. The local all-features check is blocked by Lindera dictionary downloads; full-feature validation remains required in CI. Fresh native HTML and Agda time and memory measurements are committed.\n\nMerge and release follow only after all required pre-merge checks pass. Published npm/crates.io verification, published downstream workloads, required merge enforcement and post-merge freshness reports remain part of delivery.","created_at":"2026-10-07T13:05:18Z","updated_at":"2026-10-10T09:29:42Z","closed_at":null,"merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"26e557961093a592314441577f9517cd2a3cd017","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":true,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/link-foundation/meta-language/pulls/201/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/link-foundation/meta-language/pulls/201/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/link-foundation/meta-language/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/link-foundation/meta-language/issues/201/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/link-foundation/meta-language/statuses/e46e196db5ec34bf13a73b8645aa38d409737e60","head":{"label":"link-foundation:issue-199-58f3573d6122","ref":"issue-199-58f3573d6122","sha":"e46e196db5ec34bf13a73b8645aa38d409737e60","user":{"login":"link-foundation","id":176174013,"node_id":"O_kgDOCoAzvQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/176174013?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/link-foundation","html_url":"https://github.com/link-foundation","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/link-foundation/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/link-foundation/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/link-foundation/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/link-foundation/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https:/